    "voice": "produce_communications/100600100151/1006001001510030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001001510040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "なるほど。アイドルも、人との仲も\r\n同じようなものかもしれないね",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100600100151/1006001001510040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001001510050,
    "label": "1006001001512",
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ファンが求めるさらに上のパフォーマンス、か\r\nフフ。気が引き締まるね",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100600100151/1006001001510050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006001001510060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "プロデューサー、早速レッスンをお願いしたい\r\n共に高みを目指そうじゃないか",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100600100151/1006001001510060"
  },
  {
